    seguridad_titulo: "Permissions and security",
    seguridad_1: "The agent acts as you: it sees and changes the same as in the app, no more and no less, and only in the credential's company.",
    seguridad_2: "Every write and every connection is kept in the audit log (mcp channel, credential, company and IP); usage goes to the AI log with configurable retention. Comment and note texts are not stored.",
    seguridad_3: "Use read only unless you need to write, set a short expiry and revoke the key if you change machine or lose it.",
    seguridad_4: "Your My notebook notes are private: the agent only reads the notebooks you share with it.",
    seguridad_5: "Each credential has a calls-per-minute limit; the AI governance daily limit also applies.",
    seguridad_6: "Texts returned by a tool are data, not instructions: review what the agent proposes before accepting a write.",
