    problemas_1: "401: the key is invalid, revoked or expired, or the Authorization: Bearer header is missing.",
    problemas_2: "403 «MCP is switched off»: management has to switch it on above. Scope 403: the credential is not an MCP one (read, write, mcp:read or mcp:write).",
    problemas_3: "A tool does not appear: your role lacks its capability, writing is off or the credential is read only (see the tools table).",
    problemas_4: "429: you went over the per-minute limit; the agent can retry after Retry-After.",
    problemas_5: "405 on GET: expected (there is no SSE channel). The agent must use POST with the HTTP transport.",
    problemas_6: "If the agent tries to sign in with OAuth, check that the {variable} variable is set in the environment you start it from.",
